            "review_title": "Review at 13% Gastro Wine",
            "review_text": "Syrah\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam30 contributions\n0\nA must-try place in Saigon\nJun 2020\nIt's just open for over a month and everything is excellent, so far. They have huge wine list with many options, I have tried some of them and I have nothing to complain, even the most affordable wine is only 550k, it's very good wine, combined with the food serving perfectly. You can go with your friends to relax or even by yourself, sitting comfortably at the bar, Im sure the friendly manager and staff there will be your friend soon.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 25, 2020",
