            "review_title": "Review at 13% Gastro Wine",
            "review_text": "Quynh D\nVietnam43 contributions\n1\nAmazing place for wine lover and good place to chill\nMay 2020\nGood selection of wine and nice menu.\n\nWe started with Special Charcuterie plate of Iberico Bellota, chorizo, coppa ham and salami. That was greatest welcome on board ever.\nHighly recomend the Beef tenderloin with Mushroom and Blue Chesse sauce. We all love this meal a lot as much as the octopus.\nThe restaurant has a huge wine selection and impressive cheese. \n\nAll staff have good knowledge of wine, just ask them then they could bring the good pairing.\nThe atmosphere is so nice with good choice of light, music and vintage decoration.\n\nA must in HCMC and our favourite place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 18, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
