            "review_title": "Review at 13% Gastro Wine",
            "review_text": "Dorcel\nChamonix, France8 contributions\n1\nA taste of France in Vietnam\nFeb 2020 • Friends\nThe sirloin is of excellent quality, tasty and juicy, and comes with authentic Dijon mustards. And the wine selection is really impressive, with references that I could only find in France so far. Ask the staff for wine pairing advice. The manager is very professional and friendly, and knows how to turn a simple dinner into an unforgettable party! A must in HCMC\nWritten February 20, 2020",
